# inc-z1ba: the switches every tools/check_illusion_spotted.sh session needs.
# Included by tools/keys/illusion-spotted-*.keys.
#
# Wizard switches (src/Tables.cpp, in menu order): Ignore Spell Failure is the
# 6th, Infinite Mana the 8th, Freeze Monsters the 11th. The cursor opens on the
# first, so the downs below are the gaps between them.
s               # one real turn, so the load is in play
w
y           # "Enter wizard mode?" -- yes
w           # [w] Wizard Mode Switches
DOWN*5
SPACE
DOWN*2
SPACE
DOWN*3
SPACE
@dump:switches
ESC
@dump:afterswitch

